PACK messages 1
-- A CHAT MESSAGE'S WORDS, FROM THE STORE (operator 2026-11-12, Memo could not read a message's body from a getter). Every
-- message the seat hears is a `discourse` event in the store with its text, its chat (`conv` = 'sid:<chat>') and its time.
-- A Message entity that carries its chat (`sid`) and time (`ts`) reads its own words back: `this.body`. (A message minted
-- with `text` has it already; `body` is for the ones that carry only role, session, time and who.)
Message.stored getter:
  WHEN this.sid == None or this.ts == None: None
  ELSE: sql("SELECT json_extract(body,'$.d.text') AS text FROM c_events WHERE json_extract(body,'$.d.stream') = 'discourse' AND json_extract(body,'$.d.conv') = ? AND json_extract(body,'$.d.ts') >= ? AND json_extract(body,'$.d.ts') <= ? ORDER BY json_extract(body,'$.d.seq') LIMIT 1", 'sid:' + str(this.sid), this.ts - 2, this.ts + 2)
Message.body getter: this.text if this.text != None else (prop(this.stored[0], 'text') if this.stored != None and len(this.stored) > 0 else None)
